{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-02_end",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-02",
  "title": "雨中漫步",
  "storyCode": "4-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7a4ed17c673c89897367a4e50db63a56b71a8308ed2664bd4afa83d7b9d36cfc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_r"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......！小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱，抱歉，我不是有意撞过来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没事的。你很有礼貌呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，姐姐你在这里做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里可还在下雨呢，为什么不躲一躲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......嗯......我只是......出来走走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在找人帮忙吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！姐姐是怎么知道的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能告诉你！这可是姐姐的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔唔......不管了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，能不能请你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像......不太行。姐姐，你的个子，太小了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可不能这么说别人！你明明比我矮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，那我们试试吧......嗯......能不能帮我抬一下那块板子？一起来吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个铁架下面，有台留声机，我想拿回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "1......2......3！嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成功了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，姐姐力气还蛮大的呢！谢谢姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......这个留声机......还是坏了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系！因为它最开始就是坏的呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总有一天可以修好的。我给大家收集了不少唱片，虽然从来都没听过——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————但总有一天，我会给大家放的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如此轻松的说着这些艰难的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我到底是为了什么......又能做什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐不怕我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怕什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可是感染者哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......我也是呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么！太可惜了，姐姐长得这么可爱，居然是感染者......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者不是什么问题。无论是健康人还是感染者——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你如果是个好孩子，就一直是个好孩子哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉——？我听不懂呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咕噜......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......饿了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......给，我只带了这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了！谢谢你，兔姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过你.....为什么来这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为我答应过一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐再见！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，再见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就连那样的孩子，最后，最后也只会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "被剥夺了身份的人。感染者。你们早已不是人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能做什么呢，我又能，再多做些什么呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么......我不能保护大家呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "饥荒......迫害......死亡......\n感染者终究只有这样的结局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是这样的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要罗德岛还在为了感染者....."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你只是少数幸运儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，所有人都聚在一起，向着共同的目标，不断地努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这片大地已经麻木。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还没有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者绝不能就此陷入绝望......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你。\n被愤怒吞噬吧。\n只有———————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......我不会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我答应过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我答应过她——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是......?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个姐姐和我说过，这个布偶，只有亲手做的才有用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以所以，这个送给你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "另一个少女的声音",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——————。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才那个声音是 ......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个背影————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是陈小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——————。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————————————。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——————————————————————————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "另一个少女的声音",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——————。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_r"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈长官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈长官，你来这里是要做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以为......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不关你的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙门的事情，我会处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_r"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈长官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我第一次看到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是那样的眼神......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
